OL,3,GNEWSATwo drivers seriously injured in
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men are in hospital with serious
OL,7,Finjuries following a crash near the
OL,8,Fborder of North Yorkshire and East
OL,9,FYorkshire, police have said.
OL,11,FThe collision happened at about 20:40
OL,12,FBST on Monday on the B1249 between
OL,13,FFoxholes and Langtoft.
OL,15,FNorth Yorkshire Police said an
OL,16,F18-year-old man driving a blue Ford
OL,17,FFiesta and a 48-year-old man driving a
OL,18,Fblue Volvo V50 were involved in the
OL,19,Fcrash.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
