OL,3,GNEWSATwo drivers seriously injured in
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have appealed for witnesses
OL,7,Fand anyone who has dashcam footage or
OL,8,Fwho saw either vehicle beforehand is
OL,9,Fbeing asked to contact them.
